--- ADDITIONAL CHECK REQUESTED: nil deps.Transactions ---
CONFIRMED BEHAVIOUR CHANGE (regression against the documented Deps contract).
register.go:56-59 documents "Every field may be nil except Accounts". register.go:88-97 makes
deps.load() return "transaction source is not configured on this server" when Transactions is
nil. resolve_transfer previously used only deps.Transfers, so a Deps with Transfers set and
Transactions nil worked end to end.
Evidence: my TestVERIFY_NilTransactionsSourceStillWorks (fake TransferSource, deps.Transactions
= nil) against the worker's resolve.go:
  "--- FAIL ... MINT path failed with a nil Transactions source: transaction source is not
   configured on this server"
The identical test against HEAD's resolve.go: "--- PASS ... ok". So the fix does break a
configuration that previously worked.
Reachability: NOT reachable in the shipped wiring. server.go:213 guards with
`if deps.Loader != nil` and server.go:279-281 sets both Transactions and Transfers to the same
deps.Loader, so the two are never independently nil in production. The failure mode is also a
clear named error, which is what register.go:56-59 prescribes for a tool that needs a nil
dependency. Reported as fact; it is not gated by any numbered acceptance criterion and I do
not fail the task on it.

--- SUMMARY ---
1 BEHAVIOUR MET / COVERAGE MET. 2 BEHAVIOUR MET / COVERAGE NOT MET. 3 MET. 4 MET. 5 MET.
